{"title": "Multiattack: Wounded (Malus Thorm)", "pageid": 21318, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Wounded_(Malus_Thorm)", "categories": ["Passives that gain benefits at higher levels", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This page is for the passive feature. For the corresponding attack action, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Malus_Thorm)\" title=\"Multiattack (Malus Thorm)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack (Malus Thorm)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Malus_Thorm)\" title=\"Multiattack (Malus Thorm)\">Multiattack (Malus Thorm)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Wounded</b> is a passive feature of <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a> that lets him attack twice with a single <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> once he drops to 40% <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a> or below.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Malus Thorm can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Malus_Thorm)\" title=\"Multiattack (Malus Thorm)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Malus_Thorm)\" title=\"Multiattack (Malus Thorm)\">Multiattack</a> if his <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a> are at 40% or less. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty and higher, the hit point threshold is increased to 70%.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip for this feature always says the hit point threshold is 40%, even in Tactician difficulty where it is increased to 70%.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Malus Thorm's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name%3AS_TWN_Hospital_Surgeon\">character template</a> defines two copies of <code>Target_Multiattack_Surgeon</code> which are enabled/disabled based on the <code>NPC_LOADOUT_HARD</code> rule modifier.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202604\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 957/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7103/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3772/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 291/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 874966/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.977      1 -total\n 63.41%   25.348      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 30.11%   12.038      2 Template:SAI\n 27.44%   10.969      2 Template:Icon_link\n 26.34%   10.531      1 Template:Hatnote\n 26.21%   10.477      2 Template:Icon_text\n 23.24%    9.289      1 Template:PageSeo\n 22.62%    9.043      4 Template:Trim\n 22.52%    9.001      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 17.84%    7.130      2 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21318-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202604 and revision id 382186. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}